# Desktop Environment Preview Images

This directory should contain preview images for each desktop environment:

- hyprland-preview.jpg
- minimal-preview.jpg  
- gnome-preview.jpg
- kde-preview.jpg
- xfce-preview.jpg
- cinnamon-preview.jpg

Images should be:
- Size: 800x600px
- Format: JPEG
- High quality screenshots showing the desktop environment
- Include window decorations, panels, and typical desktop layout
